 to 3.1.0. I picked 2.9.4 because it is the fixed release on the 2.x line, so the change stays within the same major version.\n- **Branch:** `fix/cve-2026-31337-fastjson-2.9.4`, with two changes: the pin in `requirements.txt` and a CHANGELOG entry under Unreleased.\n- **CI:** run `ci-0001` on commit `3a05f1e86f` passed.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under the org policy, so the PR is waiting on that.", "type": "text"}]}]}